---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Kncelados"
  description="Privacy policy for KNcelados Publisher, the internal tool KNcelados uses to publish its own short-form video content."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
    <p class="text-primary font-title text-sm tracking-widest uppercase">
      [ Legal ]
    </p>
    <h1 class="font-title mt-2 text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
      KNcelados Publisher — Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="text-secondary mt-3 font-sans text-sm">
      Last updated: 17 November 2026
    </p>

    <p class="text-secondary mt-8 font-sans">
      KNcelados Publisher uses TikTok's Content Posting API to upload and publish
      videos to the TikTok account of KNcelados, with the authorisation of its
      owner.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-title text-primary mt-10 text-xl">What the tool stores</h2>
    <p class="text-secondary mt-3 font-sans">
      The tool stores the OAuth access and refresh tokens required to publish on
      that account. Those tokens are kept on a privately owned server and are
      never shared with third parties.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-title text-primary mt-10 text-xl">
      What the tool does not do
    </h2>
    <p class="text-secondary mt-3 font-sans">
      The tool does not collect, process or store personal data of any TikTok
      user. It does not read inbox messages, follower lists, or any data
      belonging to other accounts.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-title text-primary mt-10 text-xl">Revoking access</h2>
    <p class="text-secondary mt-3 font-sans">
      Access can be revoked at any time from TikTok's settings under “Manage app
      permissions”. Revocation immediately ends the tool's access.
    </p>

    <p class="text-secondary mt-10 font-sans">
      Contact:
      <a
        href="mailto:hola@kncelados.com"
        class="font-title underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary"
        >hola@kncelados.com</a
      >
      ·
      <a
        href="/terms"
        class="font-title underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary"
        >Terms of Service</a
      >
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
